225
00:12:27,020 --> 00:12:27,900
Whoa, what?

226
00:12:28,740 --> 00:12:33,240
I was just joking with you. Besides, shouldn't I be the one freaked by that question?

227
00:12:33,780 --> 00:12:35,900
