228
00:12:36,200 --> 00:12:39,820
Your uniform. You go to Ryzen, don't you?

229
00:12:40,820 --> 00:12:42,420
Yeah, that's right.

230
00:12:42,560 --> 00:12:47,120
Well then let's try this again. I'm Miku Izayoi and I go to Rindoji.

231
00:12:47,120 --> 00:12:51,160
Right on. It's nice to meet you. My name's Shiori Itsuka.

232
00:12:52,460 --> 00:12:54,060
That's a very pretty name.

233
