So, uh, I thought this place was supposed to be off limits. What were you doing in here by yourself, Miku?

235
00:13:05,400 --> 00:13:08,520
I love the stage. I have a hard time keeping away.

236
00:13:09,120 --> 00:13:10,160
You love the stage?

237
00:13:10,160 --> 00:13:18,240
Yes. I love feeling like everyone needs to hear my voice. When I sing, I can almost feel the excitement crackling through the air.

238
